 $A:$\n\n$$\ndet(A)=k-4\n$$\n\nSince we want the entry ${a}_{22}^{′}$ in ${A}^{-1},$ we need to know the value of ${c}_{22}$ in the matrix of cofactors. For this, we use the formula to get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{c}_{22} & =(-1)^{2+2}|\\begin{aligned}1 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}1 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =1-0 \\\\  & =1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, since ${A}^{-1}=\\frac{1}{det(A)}{C}^{T},$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{a}_{22}^{′} & =\\frac{1}{\\text{det}(A)}{c}_{22} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{k-4}\\cdot 1 \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{k-4}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, since we are told that ${a}_{22}^{′}=-\\frac{1}{4}$, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-\\frac{1}{4} & =\\frac{1}{k-4} \\\\ k-4 & =-4 \\\\ k & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535411 true] [17592186347782 1000 #edb/ref 17592186347783 13194139535411 true] [17592186347782 1000 #edb/ref 17592186347784 13194139535411 true] [17592186347782 1000 #edb/ref 17592186347785 13194139535411 true] [17592186347782 1000 #edb/ref 17592186347786 13194139535411 true] [17592186347782 1000 #edb/ref 17592186347787 13194139535411 true] [17592186347782 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535411 true] [17592186347782 1041 "selection" 13194139535411 true] [17592186347782 1104 #edb/ref 17592186347785 13194139535411 true] [17592186347782 1110 #uuid "4f8d4ac4-b27f-597f-a0de-37df5c34ace9" 13194139535411 true] [17592186347783 1034 "2" 13194139535411 true] [17592186347783 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535411 true] [17592186347783 1111 #uuid "91bbefe7-ed13-535e-92df-53f8f98265ef" 13194139535411 true] [17592186347784 1034 "1" 13194139535411 true] [17592186347784 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535411 true] [17592186347784 1111 #uuid "81a52357-0ef1-5563-a3fa-115cb5ccac9e" 13194139535411 true] [17592186347785 1034 "0" 13194139535411 true] [17592186347785 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535411 true] [17592186347785 1111 #uuid "d21864fb-dc96-560d-bbad-6c2e2eb12d58" 13194139535411 true] [175921863477